{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thief's Adventure</strong> is a real-time tactical stealth game that follows <i>Hector the Thief</i> and his comrades through a medieval fantasy world filled with danger and opportunity. Plan your moves carefully, sneak past guards, loot valuables, and strike from the shadows - but remember, a single mistake can ruin it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique characters that complement each other with their abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels that demand creativity, patience, and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of environments, including countryside villages, bustling towns, gloomy prisons, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight, character-driven story that unfolds across each mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and ambience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877520?t=1766750193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877520?t=1766750193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/0fb0f55602bb654b0580e941b70eae144cce3c06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766750193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877520/0fb0f55602bb654b0580e941b70eae144cce3c06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766750193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descri